              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kandi nitubamanyisa eby'abanyamurwa, Abaleevi, abeeshongozi, abakumiirizi, abaheereza b'omuri hekalu n'abandi bakozi b'omuri egyo nju ya Ruhanga boona oku baingana, ku mutarikwizibwa kubatoijesa emitoijo, nari okubahsoza omushoro, n'obu kwakuba okubahooza ehoozi.",
          "type": "text",
