          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " kandi n'ahabw'okumpa okugirirwa embabazi omu maisho g'omugabe n'abahi b'obwengye be, n'omu maisho g'abategyeki be boona ab'obushoboorozi. Nikyo naahamiire ahabw'omukono gwa MUKAMA Ruhanga wangye ogwabaire gundiho, nkateerana abakuru bamwe omuri Israeli ngu twinamukane.",
